### Test Booking Services Calculation Fix

### 1. Tạo booking với services có quantity
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listingId": "{{listingId}}",
  "checkInDate": "2025-08-28",
  "checkOutDate": "2025-08-29",
  "guests": 2,
  "infants": 0,
  "services": [
    {
      "serviceId": "{{serviceId1}}",
      "quantity": 3
    },
    {
      "serviceId": "{{serviceId2}}",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ],
  "voucherCode": "WINTER2025"
}

### 2. Kiểm tra booking được tạo với calculation đúng
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{propertyId}}/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3. Cập nhật services với quantity khác
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{propertyId}}/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "selected_services": [
    {
      "serviceId": "{{serviceId1}}",
      "quantity": 5
    },
    {
      "serviceId": "{{serviceId2}}",
      "quantity": 2
    },
    {
      "serviceId": "{{serviceId3}}",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 4. Kiểm tra booking sau khi update với calculation đúng
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{propertyId}}/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Test validation - Service không cho phép quantity > 1
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{propertyId}}/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "selected_services": [
    {
      "serviceId": "{{serviceIdNoQuantity}}",
      "quantity": 3
    }
  ]
}

### 6. Test validation - Giảm số lượng service đã có
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{propertyId}}/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "selected_services": [
    {
      "serviceId": "{{serviceId1}}",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Variables cho test
# @baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
# @authToken = your_jwt_token_here
# @propertyId = your_property_id_here
# @bookingId = your_booking_id_here
# @listingId = your_listing_id_here
# @serviceId1 = service_id_that_allows_quantity
# @serviceId2 = another_service_id_that_allows_quantity
# @serviceId3 = third_service_id_that_allows_quantity
# @serviceIdNoQuantity = service_id_that_does_not_allow_quantity
